---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Enterprise Homelab">

<section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-20">

  <h1 class="text-5xl font-bold">
    Enterprise Homelab
  </h1>

  <p class="mt-6 text-xl text-slate-400">
    A production-style enterprise infrastructure built with virtualization,
    Active Directory, enterprise networking, automation, and centralized
    monitoring.
  </p>

  <div class="mt-10 flex flex-wrap gap-3">

    <span class="rounded bg-slate-800 px-4 py-2">Proxmox</span>
    <span class="rounded bg-slate-800 px-4 py-2">Windows Server</span>
    <span class="rounded bg-slate-800 px-4 py-2">Active Directory</span>
    <span class="rounded bg-slate-800 px-4 py-2">pfSense</span>
    <span class="rounded bg-slate-800 px-4 py-2">Ansible</span>
    <span class="rounded bg-slate-800 px-4 py-2">Wazuh</span>
    <span class="rounded bg-slate-800 px-4 py-2">Prometheus</span>
    <span class="rounded bg-slate-800 px-4 py-2">Grafana</span>

  </div>

</section>

<section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-10">

<h2 class="text-3xl font-bold">
Project Overview
</h2>

<p class="mt-6 leading-8 text-slate-400">

This project simulates an enterprise IT environment using
Proxmox virtualization.

The environment includes:

</p>

<ul class="mt-8 space-y-3 text-slate-300 list-disc pl-6">

<li>Domain Controllers</li>

<li>Active Directory</li>

<li>DNS & DHCP</li>

<li>Windows 11 Client</li>

<li>Linux Servers</li>

<li>pfSense Firewall</li>

<li>Ansible Automation</li>

<li>Prometheus Monitoring</li>

<li>Grafana Dashboards</li>

<li>Wazuh SIEM</li>

</ul>

</section>

<section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-10">

<h2 class="text-3xl font-bold">

Skills Demonstrated

</h2>

<div class="mt-8 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2">

<div class="rounded-xl bg-slate-900 p-6">

<h3 class="font-bold text-cyan-400">

Infrastructure

</h3>

<ul class="mt-4 space-y-2">

<li>Enterprise Networking</li>

<li>Active Directory</li>

<li>DNS</li>

<li>DHCP</li>

<li>Group Policy</li>

<li>Virtualization</li>

</ul>

</div>

<div class="rounded-xl bg-slate-900 p-6">

<h3 class="font-bold text-cyan-400">

Security

</h3>

<ul class="mt-4 space-y-2">

<li>SIEM</li>

<li>Firewall</li>

<li>Network Segmentation</li>

<li>Monitoring</li>

<li>Automation</li>

<li>System Hardening</li>

</ul>

</div>

</div>

</section>

</BaseLayout>
